The Mode 1/2 traversal algorithms, small-port-span heuristic and bounded
success scoring are adapted from frp v0.71.0 (commit 4a23aa181c1d7e28eecaa8216024ed753b9d27c8):
https://github.com/fatedier/frp/tree/v0.71.0/pkg/nathole
